No ssh, network, Orchard, GPU, Git, tmux, scheduler or other agents. Never list, search or grep on /home or /data*: read only named files there. Write only under L (minus the excluded rehearsal files). No deletion. Every CPU process runs under `nice -n 10` with at most 8 threads, under 20 GB RAM. Do not change the tree, config, admission, legality, removals, opener rows, the step-544 lineage, the resolver identity checks or the DEFERRED boundary. GO stays false except in `out/kit_n_go` and `out/kit_n_go_armed`, which are not uploaded by you.
